✅1.Believe in Allah 

📖 Surah Al-Ikhlās – Ayah 1

قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ
Qul Huwa Allahu Ahad

🔑 Translation (Roman Urdu):

“Keh do (Ya Rasool ﷺ), wohi Allah hai, jo Yakeenan Ek hai.”

💡Tafseer –

Qul → “Keh do” – Allah apne Nabi ﷺ ko direct address karke keh rahe hain.
Huwa Allahu → “Woh Allah hai” – yeh ta’keed hai ke sirf Allah hi Haqeeqi Ma’bood hai.
Ahad → “Ek” – Matlab Allah ki zaat wahid hai, uska koi shareek nahi, na zaat mein, na sifaat mein.

👉 Ye ayah tauheed ki buniyad hai. Yani ibadat, dua, madad – sirf aur sirf Allah se mangni chahiye.

